      "message": "Prove the six-set lower bound for open sphere covers (#23895)\n\n* WIP: construct acute sphere-cover map and Brouwer obstruction\n\nPreserve the exact cover target, component refinement, normalized map and simplex obstruction under development. No proof completion or freeze is claimed.\n\n* WIP: strengthen open sphere cover endpoint to lower six\n\nConstruct perpendicular-circle restriction and three absent colors; reuse the general dimension-two estimate on the live path to lower6. Repair saved Brouwer endpoint API calls. Lean verification remains in progress.\n\n* WIP: preserve source-owned lower-six audit attempt\n\nKeep exact source bindings and literature attribution; remove temporary build and checkpoint files from the source snapshot. Kernel verification is pending.\n\n* WIP: link current source-owned sphere-cover audit exception\n\nUse issue 23724 for the unfinished four-slot source-family registration. Keep the precise mathematical source and inherited Brouwer construction pending the queued scoped build.\n\n* WIP: compile sphere obstruction and repair cover multiplicity elaboration\n\nThe saved Brouwer obstruction now compiles. Repair classical filter signatures and the finite refinement attachment cardinality bridge; complete lower-six verification remains in progress.\n\n* Prove lower six for relatively open orthogonality-free covers of the two-sphere\n\nThe perpendicular-circle restriction forces three absent original colors at each point. The acute component refinement and normalized-map obstruction exclude a cover with at most five colors. The scoped D5 build passes; retain faithful Scribe, antecedent attribution and the linked audit exception.\n\n* Port TauCeti sphere obstruction endpoint\n\n* Trim sphere port imports to endpoint closure\n\n* Trim TauCeti sphere endpoint to live closure\n\n* Restore TauCeti subdivision homotopy projection\n\n* Adapt TauCeti homotopy endpoint to pinned Mathlib\n\n* Adapt TauCeti small homotopy endpoint\n\n* Restore TauCeti antipodal sphere cover helper\n\n* Port TauCeti Euclidean sphere dimension lemma\n\n* Specialize sphere obstruction finrank instance\n\n* Record measured TauCeti endpoint closure\n\n* WIP: align sphere obstruction prose with TauCeti homology\n\n* Checkpoint canonical lower-six selective emitter outputs\n\nWIP: emitter and publication complete; root review remains before freeze.\n\n* WIP: preserve source universes in retained lower-sphere Reg mirror\n\nBind the eight failing type_of% aliases to the exact source universe parameters.\n\n* Freeze the open orthogonality-free sphere cover lower bound\n\nCanonical deposit-uncovered and selective emission passed with the unchanged 51-module report. Preserve the complete lower-six proof and the independently compiled universe correction; four-slot registration remains unfinished under #23724.\n\n* fix(topology): declare canonical TauCeti source-port metadata\n\nPrepend truthful generality, mirror waivers and utility metadata to the 49 consumed TauCeti support modules. Preserve all original source bytes and attribution.",
